 *   **Strengths:** Enforces global coherence and mitigates Gaussian overfitting by ensuring consistent error patterns across views with high structural similarity [S1].
-*   **Limitations:** Relies on the SSIM threshold; if set too high, few pairs are selected, reducing regularization. If set too low, dissimilar views may introduce noise [S1].
